    {
      "title": "US signs landmark nuclear deal with Saudi Arabia that could pave the way for domestic nuclear enrichment",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/22/trump-nuclear-agreement-saudi-arabia",
      "description": "<p>Trump administration hails agreement, which comes as the US fights a war with Iran in part to prevent Tehran enriching uranium domestically</p><p>The US has signed a landmark nuclear deal with Saudi Arabia that could allow the kingdom to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/22/saudi-arabia-would-enrich-uranium-under-reported-deal-with-us\">enrich uranium</a> in the future.</p><p>In a <a href=\"https://x.com/HibaNasr/status/2080032614094647751\">statement</a> on Wednesday, the US Department of Energy said its secretary, Chris Wright, and his Saudi counterpart, Prince Abdulaziz bin Salman, signed a “peaceful nuclear cooperation agreement”, along with a “bilateral safeguards agreement”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/22/trump-nuclear-agreement-saudi-arabia\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-07-23T00:00:27"
    },
    {
      "title": "How the Trump Administration’s Nuclear Deal With Saudi Arabia May Work",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/22/world/middleeast/us-saudi-arabia-nuclear-deal-123-agreement.html",
      "description": "The Trump administration  announced an agreement with Saudi Arabia on a civilian nuclear program. Such deals, known as 123 Agreements, are designed to prevent the development of weapons.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-07-22T20:43:49"
    },
    {
      "title": "Coveted U.S. Nuclear Deal Is a Coup for Saudi Crown Prince",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/22/world/middleeast/us-saudi-arabia-nuclear-deal.html",
      "description": "Saudi Arabia has for years sought a deal to obtain American nuclear technology. The agreement, signed on Wednesday, could deepen U.S.-Saudi ties for decades to come.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-07-22T20:54:10"
    },
    {
      "title": "Saudi Arabia’s Nuclear Plans",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/22/world/saudi-nuclear-deal-trump-houthis.html",
      "description": "The U.S. will help the Saudis develop a civilian nuclear program, with uncertain consequences for the Middle East.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-07-22T20:52:54"
    },
